<title>USA: GTE Q3 shr $0.78 vs $0.71 excluding gain.</title>
<headline>GTE Q3 shr $0.78 vs $0.71 excluding gain.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.78		    $0.71</p>
<p> Oper net		 756,000		  695,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,344,000		4,996,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 965,000		  970,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Year-ago net excludes $12 million, $0.01 per share gain from sale of some local telephone assets.  </p>
<p>		NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $2.06		    $1.87</p>
<p> Oper net	     2,006,000		1,808,000</p>
<p> Revs		  15,588,000	     14,593,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 971,000		  969,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Current year nine months net excludes $8 million, $0.01 per share gain from sale of some local telephone assets.</p>
<p>Prior year nine mths excludes $0.01 shr gain.</p>
</text>
